<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>This site is a set of static pages. It has no accounts, forms or comments, and it stores nothing about you on its own.</p>
<h2>Analytics</h2>
<p>With your permission only, we use Google Analytics to count visits. It sets cookies in your browser and sends Google the page you are on. If you choose "No cookies", or do not answer, nothing is requested from Google.</p>
<p>Your choice is saved in your browser (local storage, key <code>analytics</code>). Change your mind with the "Cookie settings" button in the footer. To withdraw consent, choose "No cookies" and clear this site's cookies in your browser.</p>
